PERMITTED USE
-------------
You are permitted to:

 1. Download the official Loom .jar from its official distribution
    channels (the project's Modrinth page, GitHub releases, or any
    channel explicitly authorized in writing by the copyright holder).
 2. Run the official .jar on any Minecraft server you own or operate.
 3. Edit Loom's own configuration files (config.yml and the files Loom
    writes to manage server-icon.png, MOTD, etc.) for your own server.
 4. Use Loom to install, configure, and manage other plugins on your
    own server.

